{"4582380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hide and Shoot", "steam_appid": 4582380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for taking an interest in our little father-and-son hobby project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game began as an idea from my 8-year-old son, and I thought it would be a wonderful way to help bring his imagination to life while teaching him a little about game development along the way. It has been a fun, creative journey for both of us, full of learning, laughter, and plenty of “what if we added this?” moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is still a pre-release version, so the game is very much a work in progress. We’ll keep improving it, adding new ideas, and letting it grow over time. Feel free to join our Discord server and share your personal thoughts and ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks again for being part of the journey - it means a lot to both of us.<br><br>---------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/13d859dfa6666a15bd54d24368275446.avif?t=1780235264\" width=198 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/227ccd07b0620d15bb588a88ddad3aea.avif?t=1780235264\" width=224 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide and Shoot is a fun, silly and chaotic multiplayer hide-and-seek party game where up to 10 players go head-to-head as shapeshifting prey and bow-wielding hunters across colorful nature biomes. With quick, replayable rounds and plenty of clip-worthy moments, it’s perfect for game-night rotations with friends, streamer lobbies, and casual stream sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/0f72e929ce8b6fe810e953d897f5e3e2.poster.avif?t=1780235264\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/0f72e929ce8b6fe810e953d897f5e3e2.webm?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/0f72e929ce8b6fe810e953d897f5e3e2.mp4?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Hunters vs. Prey</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, one or two players become Hunters armed with bows. Everyone else becomes Prey, and survival means blending in, staying calm, and escaping before it is too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prey can shapeshift into cows, deer, sheep, and shrubbery to hide among the world around them. But be careful: shapeshifting drains energy, and hunters are always watching for anything that looks suspicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/83138bf3a2b8fe3e8874ea48ce82013d.poster.avif?t=1780235264\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/83138bf3a2b8fe3e8874ea48ce82013d.webm?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/83138bf3a2b8fe3e8874ea48ce82013d.mp4?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/850b34e6a1625c58630b239838de2cae.avif?t=1780235264\" width=256 height=184 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/bea75ddd30d49e15d03b12345fa3f292.avif?t=1780235264\" width=256 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Outsmart, Outrun, Escape</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay hidden long enough and an escape portal will spawn. Reach it to win. Get caught by the hunter, and you are out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Prey, you have plenty of tricks to survive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapeshift into animals and bushes to hide in plain sight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide into cover to escape faster or trick the hunter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge out of arrow fire with a quick double-tap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use movement, timing, and fake-outs to make the hunter miss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nervous Stomach — the closer the hunter gets, the more your stomach churns. Hold it in, or let it rip for a fart-powered launch into the sky </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/6be587836f11be1819334f14dc7f48ff.poster.avif?t=1780235264\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/6be587836f11be1819334f14dc7f48ff.webm?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/6be587836f11be1819334f14dc7f48ff.mp4?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Hunt with Precision</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters move faster, track suspicious movement, and can activate a speed boost to chase down fleeing prey. They can also plant proximity devices that detect nearby prey and slow them down, making escape much harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up your shots carefully. Arrows have real physics, with travel time and arc, so every hit takes skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/84b42b19753c8be50642841c0a88ae78.poster.avif?t=1780235264\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/84b42b19753c8be50642841c0a88ae78.webm?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/84b42b19753c8be50642841c0a88ae78.mp4?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Play Your Way</strong></i></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 10 players per match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head with friends, bots, or both</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 bot difficulty tiers, from Easy to Hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of configurable match settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host games through Steam or local room codes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends directly from your Steam friends list</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/952b546f4b562d43bab7bccb2d03143f.poster.avif?t=1780235264\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/952b546f4b562d43bab7bccb2d03143f.webm?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/952b546f4b562d43bab7bccb2d03143f.mp4?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Key Features</strong></i></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, funny rounds perfect for parties, streaming, and game nights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic hunter-versus-prey gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart bot AI that patrols, hunts, shapeshifts, and flees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity devices that detect and slow prey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slides, dodges, fake-outs, and last-second escapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent scores across rounds with a full scoreboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ unique character skins </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/c56428e667a5215238395cce4576bd64.poster.avif?t=1780235264\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/c56428e667a5215238395cce4576bd64.webm?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/c56428e667a5215238395cce4576bd64.mp4?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends, pick your side, and see who has the nerves to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for taking an interest in our little father-and-son hobby project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game began as an idea from my 8-year-old son, and I thought it would be a wonderful way to help bring his imagination to life while teaching him a little about game development along the way. It has been a fun, creative journey for both of us, full of learning, laughter, and plenty of “what if we added this?” moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is still a pre-release version, so the game is very much a work in progress. We’ll keep improving it, adding new ideas, and letting it grow over time. Feel free to join our Discord server and share your personal thoughts and ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks again for being part of the journey - it means a lot to both of us.<br><br>---------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/13d859dfa6666a15bd54d24368275446.avif?t=1780235264\" width=198 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/227ccd07b0620d15bb588a88ddad3aea.avif?t=1780235264\" width=224 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide and Shoot is a fun, silly and chaotic multiplayer hide-and-seek party game where up to 10 players go head-to-head as shapeshifting prey and bow-wielding hunters across colorful nature biomes. With quick, replayable rounds and plenty of clip-worthy moments, it’s perfect for game-night rotations with friends, streamer lobbies, and casual stream sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"