 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/bea75ddd30d49e15d03b12345fa3f292.avif?t=1780235264\" width=256 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Outsmart, Outrun, Escape</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay hidden long enough and an escape portal will spawn. Reach it to win. Get caught by the hunter, and you are out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Prey, you have plenty of tricks to survive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapeshift into animals and bushes to hide in plain sight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide into cover to escape faster or trick the hunter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge out of arrow fire with a quick double-tap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use movement, timing, and fake-outs to make the hunter miss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nervous Stomach — the closer the hunter gets, the more your stomach churns. Hold it in, or let it rip for a fart-powered launch into the sky </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/6be587836f11be1819334f14dc7f48ff.poster.avif?t=1780235264\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/6be587836f11be1819334f14dc7f48ff.webm?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582380/extras/6be587836f11be1819334f14dc7f48ff.mp4?t=1780235264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Hunt with Precision</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters move faster, track suspicious movement, and ca